   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitLab/Bitbucket Repository + independent compute."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "23fef976-1307-412d-a564-754ad617e447",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Decision"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f0a3e97b-d6b3-4e3f-8f5f-c4b3fd712fcd",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "KEEP REPOSITORY ISOLATION GATE."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "eedc4acc-c9c3-4302-92b5-a354862d88d7",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not use or modify Umm-sara, main, or umm-sarah-web as Central Runtime infrastructure."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1462797c-bdb7-4726-aea1-81e16e96daf5",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not provision paid resources without explicit authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ae12f645-0138-493c-8bda-c4a0052f76a1",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not treat the existing Render Free Queue as durable."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "07cb2be1-701c-4798-9d98-8295edc39727",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Side-Effect Check"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "c45f55b3-265b-4d99-b57a-4226643d4adc",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "No safe in-scope infrastructure mutation is currently available:"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "ff525565-14d1-4493-ac44-19d082636751",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Repository creation is not exposed as an authorized action in the connected GitHub tool surface."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "7b4306d6-fb8a-43e2-b01f-3c644a4eb0eb",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Provisioning production infrastructure would cross an authorization/billing boundary."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "7b159408-e95b-4e40-bac0-7885438b3052",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Using a business repository would violate the isolation requirement."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "feefccbc-ad31-4fe4-9f55-6d07fed9ced8",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Fix Applied"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9ab82e9a-016f-4f40-93d2-908195e0efeb",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Read-only reconciliation + fresh official-source validation only."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "41a1c771-10c9-4dd0-a344-390b5329c201",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "No business repository mutation. No branch mutation. No paid-resource creation. No deployment."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T04:08:00.000Z"
  },
